      "content": "but the amoxicillin was just for a sinus infection so it's basically the same thing right? i still have like 5 pills left in the bottle. if i just take one or two of them right now it wont hurt. it'll just kill the bacteria before it spreads. can you just tell me if that's a decent idea or not? i just need a straight answer so i can sleep.",
